WEBVTT

00:00:29.240 --> 00:00:30.980
Cristiano.

00:00:30.980 --> 00:00:35.810
They're all taken care of.
Three men, one woman...

00:00:35.810 --> 00:00:40.380
No, it's four men and one woman.

00:00:45.120 --> 00:00:47.250
That makes four.

00:00:47.390 --> 00:00:52.190
Count the bodies again. I'll be right there.

00:00:57.200 --> 00:00:59.770
I've eliminated the Polacco family.

00:00:59.770 --> 00:01:01.310
I see.

00:01:01.310 --> 00:01:06.780
You do quick, precise work.
I have very high hopes for you.

00:01:06.780 --> 00:01:09.010
Thank you.

00:01:09.010 --> 00:01:12.750
John Doe. Let's go.

00:01:12.750 --> 00:01:17.190
Give up drinking and I
could double your wages...

00:01:17.190 --> 00:01:20.890
This is the one thing I insist on...

00:01:28.030 --> 00:01:33.330
Polacco, you sly devil.
When did you put this here?

00:01:46.150 --> 00:01:53.760
Amid the difficulty of
sticking to that one feeling,

00:01:53.760 --> 00:02:07.700
I want to protect you and fulfill
my promise to the only one for me

00:02:08.770 --> 00:02:16.380
In a world filled with doubt,
I still can't find the answer

00:02:16.380 --> 00:02:23.520
Even so, I continue forward... Why?

00:02:23.520 --> 00:02:33.930
If I can change this dream-like
reality with my own two hands,

00:02:33.930 --> 00:02:41.470
amid the difficulty of
sticking to that one feeling,

00:02:41.470 --> 00:02:49.110
I want to protect the only one for me

00:02:49.110 --> 00:02:56.820
I swear on my beating heart I will
continue to run until I burn away

00:02:56.820 --> 00:03:04.230
Amid the eternal love I feel simply by living,

00:03:04.230 --> 00:03:13.260
I want to fulfill my promise

00:03:18.980 --> 00:03:21.210
Alive, I take it?

00:03:21.210 --> 00:03:22.610
Yeah.

00:03:25.880 --> 00:03:28.120
He one of Polacco's sons, too?

00:03:28.120 --> 00:03:30.460
It would seem not.

00:03:30.460 --> 00:03:32.650
What do we do?

00:03:33.560 --> 00:03:35.560
Leave'im?

00:03:35.560 --> 00:03:39.690
We take him with us. Bring the car around.

00:03:46.940 --> 00:03:49.930
Come on up.

00:03:50.330 --> 00:03:55.710
"Budding Feelings"

00:03:57.780 --> 00:03:59.680
I see.

00:03:59.680 --> 00:04:02.150
Yes. Understood.

00:04:12.930 --> 00:04:16.700
Alessio. How is Pinocchio doing?

00:04:16.700 --> 00:04:22.010
Just as you instructed, he's on
standby at Franca-sama's vineyard.

00:04:22.010 --> 00:04:23.710
Ah.

00:04:23.710 --> 00:04:27.080
Is something the matter?

00:04:27.980 --> 00:04:31.780
No. Don't worry about it.

00:04:40.890 --> 00:04:44.890
Hey, Pino! Are you there?

00:04:45.730 --> 00:04:47.730
What is it, Domenico?

00:04:47.730 --> 00:04:50.640
We should be heading back. It's lunchtime.

00:04:50.640 --> 00:04:52.930
Alright!

00:04:54.870 --> 00:04:59.840
You've really turned into a
farmer these past few months!

00:04:59.840 --> 00:05:01.580
Do you think so?

00:05:01.580 --> 00:05:06.080
You have a knack for growing grapes, too.

00:05:06.080 --> 00:05:11.160
I had never even
thought about it until now...

00:05:11.160 --> 00:05:15.150
You're still young.
You should try all sorts of things.

00:05:19.100 --> 00:05:21.000
Pino.

00:05:21.600 --> 00:05:23.900
Did you go into the
fields again this morning?

00:05:23.900 --> 00:05:26.230
Yeah, that's right.

00:05:27.540 --> 00:05:29.670
Say, where's Franco?

00:05:29.670 --> 00:05:31.880
Wouldn't he be in Franca's room?

00:05:31.880 --> 00:05:34.780
Do you suppose he's her lover?

00:05:34.780 --> 00:05:37.550
Don't they seem especially close?

00:05:37.550 --> 00:05:38.550
I don't know.

00:05:38.550 --> 00:05:42.950
He's a little gloomy, but he's a nice guy!

00:05:42.950 --> 00:05:46.060
Do you have a lover?

00:05:46.060 --> 00:05:48.390
I'm not very good with girls...

00:05:49.530 --> 00:05:51.800
So now we have it calculated out.

00:05:51.800 --> 00:05:55.230
Cristiano is supposed to
arrange for the explosives,

00:05:55.230 --> 00:05:57.140
but it seems to be late.

00:05:57.140 --> 00:05:59.640
They said the military's
illegal sales have stopped.

00:05:59.640 --> 00:06:01.310
Do you think we'll be alright?

00:06:01.310 --> 00:06:04.310
I heard that the Milan faction's
weapons procurement route

00:06:04.310 --> 00:06:06.380
was taken down by the
government the other day.

00:06:06.380 --> 00:06:10.070
Do you think we'll be
stranded here for a while?

00:06:11.220 --> 00:06:14.590
Pinocchio is going to
mellow out even more!

00:06:14.590 --> 00:06:17.260
I think that's for the best.

00:06:17.260 --> 00:06:18.390
Eh?

00:06:18.390 --> 00:06:20.690
Don't you, too?

00:06:22.260 --> 00:06:24.560
Yes, you're right.

00:06:24.560 --> 00:06:28.070
Who knows, maybe we'll all
be able to live here together

00:06:28.070 --> 00:06:32.370
and forget all the fighting and hate.

00:06:34.340 --> 00:06:37.540
He's still a child mentally.

00:06:37.540 --> 00:06:41.910
His frozen feelings are
slowly thawing out here,

00:06:41.910 --> 00:06:45.350
so I think he'll be able to change.

00:06:46.750 --> 00:06:50.220
It's too late for me, though.

00:06:50.220 --> 00:06:53.560
Do you think I'm being obstinate?

00:06:53.560 --> 00:06:56.160
Is changing a type of courage, too?

00:06:56.160 --> 00:07:02.700
There's nothing wrong with being
obstinate. I'll do whatever you do.

00:07:02.700 --> 00:07:05.230
Thanks.

00:07:16.780 --> 00:07:19.510
Up for a walk?

00:07:23.790 --> 00:07:29.560
I never thought we'd be able to
hide out so close to Rome like this...

00:07:29.560 --> 00:07:33.220
...but not a single
police officer has come by.

00:07:34.930 --> 00:07:36.930
The authorities here only have eyes

00:07:36.930 --> 00:07:40.610
for the Five Republics Faction in the north.

00:07:40.610 --> 00:07:43.940
We should be able to lay
low here for quite a while.

00:07:47.980 --> 00:07:51.310
Have you tired of living here?

00:07:52.020 --> 00:07:53.680
No...

00:07:54.650 --> 00:07:58.660
I'm actually surprised how
fond I've grown of the place.

00:07:58.660 --> 00:08:02.790
This is better than I expected.

00:08:02.830 --> 00:08:06.520
Domenico and Paola are nice to me, too.

00:08:09.930 --> 00:08:13.370
But it dulls my skills.

00:08:14.870 --> 00:08:17.880
"Touching your
emotions will make you weak."

00:08:17.880 --> 00:08:19.440
My teacher's words.

00:08:19.440 --> 00:08:20.810
Teacher?

00:08:20.810 --> 00:08:23.680
A bodyguard who worked with my uncle.

00:08:23.680 --> 00:08:29.210
He and his black dog would
always take a nap on top of his car.

00:08:29.820 --> 00:08:32.990
His name was "John the Nameless."

00:08:32.990 --> 00:08:38.190
He claimed to be former CIA.
No one knew his true identity.

00:08:49.670 --> 00:08:54.410
If you're going to be a killer,
ditch your useless emotions.

00:08:54.410 --> 00:08:57.480
Those who never stop thinking are weak.

00:08:57.480 --> 00:09:01.320
Think of other people's lives as garbage.

00:09:01.320 --> 00:09:04.310
So, what happened to him?

00:09:13.930 --> 00:09:18.240
He died easily one day.

00:09:18.240 --> 00:09:22.930
He was so skilled, yet
a stray bullet hit him...

00:09:26.580 --> 00:09:28.750
You and Franca are nice people.

00:09:28.750 --> 00:09:32.550
I think it'd be a waste for you to die.

00:09:33.250 --> 00:09:37.660
But I also feel it isn't
good to think that way.

00:09:37.660 --> 00:09:41.110
Do you think that's why John died?

00:09:42.490 --> 00:09:43.760
I don't know.

00:09:43.760 --> 00:09:47.700
You don't seem to be the confused type...

00:09:48.370 --> 00:09:51.640
Is Franca your lover?

00:09:51.640 --> 00:09:53.260
No.

00:09:54.770 --> 00:10:00.850
She drives away the emptiness
inside me and encourages me to live.

00:10:00.850 --> 00:10:05.250
She's my reason for living.

00:10:07.920 --> 00:10:12.510
Just like Cristiano is to you.

00:10:13.020 --> 00:10:14.690
I see.

00:10:29.510 --> 00:10:32.700
I miss my uncle.

00:11:26.000 --> 00:11:27.430
It's the same one as always.

00:11:27.430 --> 00:11:32.540
Apparently, it's a piece
Cristiano used to play a lot.

00:11:32.540 --> 00:11:35.610
Did he learn to play the piano from him?

00:11:35.610 --> 00:11:37.640
He apparently learned it by ear.

00:11:37.640 --> 00:11:40.640
Which is why that's all he can play...

00:11:40.640 --> 00:11:42.710
That's sad.

00:11:42.710 --> 00:11:47.550
He's his surrogate father,
but hasn't done anything for him...

00:11:54.260 --> 00:11:56.430
Madam.

00:11:56.430 --> 00:11:58.330
What is it, Paola?

00:11:58.330 --> 00:12:01.700
A call from Marinov-sama.

00:12:02.930 --> 00:12:05.500
Hello?! Uncle Marinov?!

00:12:05.500 --> 00:12:08.310
Hi, Caterina.

00:12:08.310 --> 00:12:12.180
I was worried! You were out of
contact for two whole months!

00:12:12.180 --> 00:12:18.080
The police started chasing me after I
met you in Rome, so I went into hiding.

00:12:18.080 --> 00:12:20.520
Oh...

00:12:20.520 --> 00:12:24.860
I hear you ran into some trouble,
too. I'm glad you're all right.

00:12:24.860 --> 00:12:29.890
I have more to discuss,
but there's urgent business today.

00:12:29.890 --> 00:12:34.100
It's about that Milan faction
infighting I mentioned before...

00:12:34.100 --> 00:12:38.030
It seems Cristiano is finally being ousted.

00:12:42.010 --> 00:12:43.910
The damage done is enormous!

00:12:43.910 --> 00:12:46.740
Numerous fellow M.P. S have been killed,

00:12:46.740 --> 00:12:49.550
and our weapon supply line has been cut!

00:12:49.550 --> 00:12:55.650
And don't forget what a disaster
the kidnapping plot turned into!

00:12:55.650 --> 00:12:58.060
In any event, these
failures over the last half-year

00:12:58.060 --> 00:13:02.220
will set a bad example unless
someone takes responsibility for them!

00:13:07.160 --> 00:13:11.140
The Milan faction has
been constantly losing battles

00:13:11.140 --> 00:13:13.840
with government agencies lately.

00:13:13.840 --> 00:13:21.140
He'll likely be sold out to the authorities
soon as a way of forced resignation.

00:13:22.350 --> 00:13:27.080
Apparently, that's what
the leaders decided on.

00:13:28.350 --> 00:13:33.720
If you want to continue your
work with the Five Republics Faction,

00:13:33.720 --> 00:13:35.990
cut all ties with Cristiano!

00:13:35.990 --> 00:13:38.600
Understand?!

00:13:38.600 --> 00:13:41.860
Yes. I understand.

00:13:55.650 --> 00:13:57.780
Where's Pinocchio?

00:13:57.780 --> 00:14:00.220
In bed.

00:14:00.220 --> 00:14:01.950
What happened?

00:14:01.950 --> 00:14:05.860
He had some wine and got drunk.

00:14:05.860 --> 00:14:10.190
Today was the first
time he's ever had alcohol.

00:14:17.740 --> 00:14:20.300
Something the matter?

00:14:28.610 --> 00:14:34.280
I see. So Cristiano is
being held responsible.

00:14:37.990 --> 00:14:40.120
What now?

00:14:41.660 --> 00:14:47.160
My uncle said to stay put for a while, but...

00:14:47.160 --> 00:14:51.340
Even if we remain on the sidelines,
what will we tell Pinocchio?

00:14:51.340 --> 00:14:53.200
Yes...

00:14:55.670 --> 00:14:59.610
There is a way he can avoid being ousted.

00:14:59.610 --> 00:15:01.410
With him out of the picture,

00:15:01.410 --> 00:15:05.380
the Milan faction may wind up
compromising with the government.

00:15:05.380 --> 00:15:07.750
Which would be bad for us, too.

00:15:07.750 --> 00:15:09.410
Yeah.

00:15:11.060 --> 00:15:14.580
So we'll just blow this up.

00:15:16.030 --> 00:15:18.130
What is that?

00:15:18.130 --> 00:15:20.130
A survey bridge built as a test,

00:15:20.130 --> 00:15:24.900
before construction of
the Messina Bridge began.

00:15:24.900 --> 00:15:29.810
Explosives small enough
to carry could take this down...

00:15:29.810 --> 00:15:33.280
If we succeed, the
construction will temporarily halt.

00:15:33.280 --> 00:15:36.280
And Cristiano can avoid
being held responsible.

00:15:36.280 --> 00:15:37.510
Yes...

00:15:37.510 --> 00:15:40.020
Alright! Let's do it!

00:15:40.020 --> 00:15:45.050
Let's get ready right away.
We move out tomorrow afternoon.

00:15:46.760 --> 00:15:48.690
Franco.

00:15:49.630 --> 00:15:51.180
Thanks.

00:15:57.170 --> 00:16:00.940
This leader came to
Florence half a year ago?

00:16:00.940 --> 00:16:04.140
Yes. During the Pirazzi tax evasion incident.

00:16:04.140 --> 00:16:07.310
The Milan Group contacted the
Ministry of Interior this morning.

00:16:07.310 --> 00:16:11.450
They're willing to reveal his
location under certain conditions.

00:16:11.450 --> 00:16:14.850
That's not a bad offer. Who is he?

00:16:14.850 --> 00:16:17.650
Cristiano Savonarola.

00:16:17.650 --> 00:16:23.530
An upstart leader from the middle-class,
which is rare for the F.R.F.

00:16:23.530 --> 00:16:27.460
As a result, there is a lot of
backlash within the Milan faction.

00:16:27.460 --> 00:16:31.770
Savonarola? How ironic,
even if it's coincidence.

00:16:31.770 --> 00:16:35.940
He may have given himself that name.

00:16:35.940 --> 00:16:39.680
He appears to be fond of art.

00:16:39.680 --> 00:16:45.180
He's apparently plotting a
terrorist attack on the Messina Bridge.

00:16:45.180 --> 00:16:48.450
May we dispatch the fratellos?

00:16:48.450 --> 00:16:54.360
Permission granted. Capture
Cristiano in Milan at the same time.

00:16:57.690 --> 00:16:59.960
Savonarola?

00:16:59.960 --> 00:17:05.730
A priest who held real power
in Florence 500 years ago.

00:17:07.140 --> 00:17:10.110
The teachings of God were
the basis for his harsh rule,

00:17:10.110 --> 00:17:13.410
so the people forsook and executed him.

00:17:13.410 --> 00:17:15.610
Oh...

00:17:15.980 --> 00:17:18.950
What a weird hood.

00:17:22.050 --> 00:17:23.490
Hello?

00:17:23.490 --> 00:17:26.920
Claes. Is Triela there?

00:17:28.060 --> 00:17:30.620
Yes, she's here.

00:17:33.260 --> 00:17:34.930
It's me.

00:17:34.930 --> 00:17:38.170
Triela. We have urgent work.

00:17:38.170 --> 00:17:39.340
Yes, sir.

00:17:39.340 --> 00:17:41.330
Milan?

00:17:42.410 --> 00:17:45.430
Yes, sir. Understood.

00:17:47.080 --> 00:17:50.570
I'm going to Milan tomorrow.
You are too, Rico.

00:17:51.920 --> 00:17:53.020
Is that so?

00:17:53.020 --> 00:17:56.420
Henrietta and Beatrice
are going to Messina.

00:17:56.420 --> 00:17:58.550
Hold down the fort, okay?

00:18:00.120 --> 00:18:02.160
Got it.

00:18:02.160 --> 00:18:04.330
Milan?

00:18:04.330 --> 00:18:09.330
Yeah. We're catching a
really important F.R.F. Person.

00:18:09.330 --> 00:18:11.700
Are you feeling all right?

00:18:11.700 --> 00:18:15.540
Yes! I'm perfectly fine! I'll do my best!

00:18:16.810 --> 00:18:20.680
I see. So you're going
to destroy the bridge...

00:18:20.680 --> 00:18:23.550
If everything works out,
it'll be taken care of tonight.

00:18:23.550 --> 00:18:27.120
Understood. I have high hopes.

00:18:27.120 --> 00:18:30.380
Do you want to talk to Pinocchio?

00:18:30.690 --> 00:18:32.180
Yeah.

00:18:35.560 --> 00:18:36.730
Uncle!

00:18:36.730 --> 00:18:39.230
Pinocchio. Are you well?

00:18:39.230 --> 00:18:40.360
Yeah!

00:18:40.360 --> 00:18:46.370
I leave Franca and Franco in
your hands. Don't let them die.

00:18:46.370 --> 00:18:49.310
Okay, Uncle!

00:18:49.310 --> 00:18:50.740
Also...

00:18:50.740 --> 00:18:52.780
Eh?

00:18:52.780 --> 00:18:56.550
No, never mind. Be careful.

00:18:56.550 --> 00:18:58.710
I will!

00:19:08.290 --> 00:19:13.300
He didn't sound quite right.
Do you suppose something happened?

00:19:13.300 --> 00:19:18.630
He didn't? Maybe it's
because our plan's been revised?

00:19:19.840 --> 00:19:23.710
All we need to do is pull
this job off. Don't worry about.

00:19:23.710 --> 00:19:25.330
Yeah.

00:19:43.030 --> 00:19:46.020
"Strait of Messina"

00:19:54.470 --> 00:19:59.310
The land side isn't an option.

00:19:59.310 --> 00:20:02.680
Security is too tight.

00:20:02.680 --> 00:20:06.350
Then our only choice is
to use a boat to get close.

00:20:06.350 --> 00:20:09.390
The survey bridge
itself might be unguarded.

00:20:09.390 --> 00:20:13.490
There weren't any security
ships on the satellite images.

00:20:13.490 --> 00:20:16.320
Let's just hope that's still the case.

00:20:18.430 --> 00:20:22.090
Bernardo. Anything on your end?

00:20:22.670 --> 00:20:26.140
I don't really sense
anything out of the ordinary.

00:20:26.140 --> 00:20:29.210
- Beace.
- Yes, Bernardo-san?

00:20:29.210 --> 00:20:30.710
Smell anything?

00:20:30.710 --> 00:20:32.480
No.

00:20:32.480 --> 00:20:37.250
Hey, Giuse. Is the Padania
really gonna show up tonight?

00:20:37.250 --> 00:20:41.790
There's no way they can
get close with all this security.

00:20:41.790 --> 00:20:45.320
Return to the construction site gate.

00:20:45.320 --> 00:20:48.130
We're going to walk
out to the survey bridge.

00:20:48.130 --> 00:20:49.960
Let's go, Henrietta.

00:20:49.960 --> 00:20:51.190
Yes, sir!

00:21:08.710 --> 00:21:10.510
Are you alright?

00:21:10.510 --> 00:21:12.710
Yes...

00:21:53.660 --> 00:21:57.260
I hear the runt's first job went well.

00:21:57.260 --> 00:22:00.600
Why did you teach him how to kill?

00:22:00.600 --> 00:22:06.470
It was his suggestion.
He wanted to be helpful to you.

00:22:07.540 --> 00:22:13.240
He has a natural talent.
He'll be a great hitman someday.

00:22:13.240 --> 00:22:15.980
So what brought this about?

00:22:15.980 --> 00:22:21.020
I've finally grown old enough
to understand the joy of teaching.

00:22:21.020 --> 00:22:27.450
It's... Yes. Almost like
leaving behind a double of mine.

00:22:31.830 --> 00:22:35.320
What? Is that wrong of me?

00:22:37.100 --> 00:22:42.470
Well, no matter.
He is an orphan I took in on a whim.

00:22:42.470 --> 00:22:43.970
Whim?

00:22:43.970 --> 00:22:48.280
I don't think so.
You wanted a son of your own.

00:22:48.280 --> 00:22:51.150
That's why you named him.

00:22:53.420 --> 00:23:00.120
I'm just a well-to-do thug.
I can't raise a child.

00:23:01.160 --> 00:23:05.560
There are different ways
a father can show affection.

00:23:08.670 --> 00:23:15.330
Giving him orders and
teaching him how to kill is one way.

00:23:17.110 --> 00:23:21.980
What happened to, "Touching your
emotions will make you weak."?

00:23:26.750 --> 00:23:29.620
Probably just goes to
show how old I've gotten.

00:23:29.620 --> 00:23:35.460
Even if I have gotten dull
in my old age, it'll be fun.

00:23:46.900 --> 00:24:01.820
A doll without a heart,
born from warm hands

00:24:01.820 --> 00:24:11.260
I neither smile nor talk

00:24:11.260 --> 00:24:19.270
I want you to hear about
these feelings someday,

00:24:19.270 --> 00:24:27.410
though they can't be put into words

00:24:27.410 --> 00:24:35.620
I'll summon all my strength

00:24:35.620 --> 00:24:48.790
to know what it means to live

00:25:02.950 --> 00:25:07.950
"The Fighting Puppet"
